  "question": {
    "text": "A small particle of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and charge <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> is dropped in uniform horizontal magnetic field <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The maximum vertical displacement of particle is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>nm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> . Find the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>.</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mgh</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mv</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>gh</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br />At lowest position, velocity becomes horizontal.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>gh</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/cljopjtbyaxwfdczpvmyqscnqnjsgsmepzchjrfkgmylivqjas.png\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ma</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>QvB</mi></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ma</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>QB</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>vsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ma</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>QB</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ma</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi>QB</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>dy</mi><mi>dt</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi>dv</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><mi>dt</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>QB</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></msubsup><mi>dy</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></msubsup><msub><mi>dv</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>QBh</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>QBh</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>gh</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>",
